---An object representing the configuration for an OpenID Connect (OIDC) identity provider.
---@class aws.eks.OidcIdentityProviderConfig
---@field identityProviderConfigName? aws.eks.String The name of the configuration.
---@field identityProviderConfigArn? aws.eks.String The ARN of the configuration.
---@field clusterName? aws.eks.String The name of your cluster.
